Find the section containing a given line number. Prints breadcrumb path to stderr

Usage: mdd at [OPTIONS] <PATH> <LINE> [LEVEL]

Arguments:
  <PATH>
          File path

  <LINE>
          Line number (1-based)

  [LEVEL]
          Levels to climb up from innermost section (0 = innermost)
          
          [default: 0]

